  "$defs":{"obligation":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["id","kind","required","footprint","deadline","attemptLimit","freshness","idempotence","authorization"],"properties":{"id":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"kind":{"enum":["HARD","SOFT","EXCEPTION","MANUAL"]},"required":{"type":"boolean"},"footprint":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"deadline":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"attemptLimit":{"type":"integer","minimum":0},"freshness":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"idempotence":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"authorization":{"type":"string","minLength":1}}},"contract":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["scope","inputDomain","assumptions","obligations","footprint","observationProjection","exceptionPolicy","deadline","attemptLimit","freshness","idempotence","authorization","referenceEvaluator","costModel","contractDigest"],"properties":{"scope":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"inputDomain":{"type":"array","minItems":1,"items":{"type":"string","minLength":1}},"assumptions":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"obligations":{"type":"array","minItems":1,"items":{"$ref":"#/$defs/obligation"}},"footprint":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"observationProjection":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"exceptionPolicy":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"deadline":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"attemptLimit":{"type":"integer","minimum":0},"freshness":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"idempotence":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"authorization":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"referenceEvaluator":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"costModel":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"contractDigest":{"type":"string","pattern":"^[a-f0-9]{64}$"}}}}
